AISO Toolkit — Setup and Collection
=====================================

Run all commands from repo root (Integrated_ai/):

  Setup a new client:
    python full_stack/setup.py

  Collect data for an existing client:
    python full_stack/collect.py

Environment variables (required):
  Copy full_stack/.env.example to Integrated_ai/.env and fill in:
    OPENAI_API_KEY
